    "tool_end_deliberation": "end_deliberation(message): guarded so it cannot run before min_time unless hit_max. Sets phase=ending, collects final one-statement positions from ALL members in parallel, logs each as a final_statement, writes meeting_end, sets phase=complete, and returns the statements + 'now write the memo to <path>'.",
    "constraint_engine": "getConstraintState (modules/helpers.ts): elapsed = now - startTime; approaching_max = >= max*0.8; hit_max = elapsed>=maxTime OR spent>=maxBudget; hit_max_reason distinguishes time/budget/both. Budget accumulates from every board-member cost AND the CEO's own message_end cost.",
