    "input_lockdown": "on('input') blocks all user text; ~20 built-in slash commands (help, clear, model, compact, cost, etc.) are shadowed to show a blocking notice. Only /ceo-begin (start), stop (hard abort), and wrap (force end_deliberation via a steer message) are honored. This is what makes it 'not a conversation.'",
