+          <li><strong>Close the loop:</strong> if <code>ELEVENLABS_API_KEY</code>, Python/<code>uv</code>, and the playback environment are configured, verify <code>summary.mp3</code> is created. Grade the file, not whether the editor or audio player visibly opens.</li>
