+          <div class="lab-box__pass"><h4>Pass criteria</h4><ul><li>7 points: all four sections contain specific, learner-owned facts.</li><li>5 points: at least one relevant sibling Markdown context file.</li><li>5 points: demonstrated missing-section failure and repaired success.</li><li>5 points: trace from a generated statement to exact source context.</li><li>3 points: budget rationale and observed data stated without unsupported causality.</li></ul></div>
+        </div>
+
+        <div class="lab-box">
+          <h3 class="lab-box__title">Lab 3 · Make a deterministic roster change</h3>
